# .gitignore for the PeEx competency kit.
#
# Two rules of thumb behind everything below:
#   1. Nothing that can authenticate as you leaves this folder.
#   2. Nothing that a command can regenerate gets committed.
#
# What is deliberately NOT ignored, because it is evidence:
#   proof/**                          executed output — the point of the kit
#   06-containers/config/app.env      the config file update-config.sh changes;
#                                     it holds PORT/NODE_ENV, no secrets
#   *.tfvars.example                  templates with placeholder values
#   *.pub                             public keys are meant to be shared
#   .terraform.lock.hcl               provider pins belong in version control
#                                     (note: some per-section .gitignore files
#                                     still exclude it — see the README)

# ─── Private keys and credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*_key
.peexops_key
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
credentials.json
service-account*.json
sa-*.json

# Environment files that hold real values. Note this matches a file NAMED
# `.env`, not `app.env` — the containers kit's config file stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Terraform ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# State is the dangerous one: `tls_private_key` writes the PRIVATE half into
# terraform.tfstate in cleartext, so ignoring only the .pem is not enough.
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Real variable files may carry your IP or account details; keep the examples.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Saved plans can embed variable values, and the provider cache is ~700MB
# per stack — both are regenerated by `terraform init` / `terraform plan`.
tfplan
tfplan.*
.terraform/

# ─── SSH scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-run known_hosts files the scripts create; transient by design.
.known_hosts*

# ─── Language / tool caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.retry

# ─── Editor and OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
